Message - Message queue

Message queue:
 - SystemV
 - SystemD

SystemV:
 - No named virtual filesystem
 - ftok(), msgget(), msgsnd()

SystemD:
 - named virtual filesystem
 - mq_attr - mq_maxmsg, mq_msgsize, mq_curmsgs
 - mq_open(), mq_send(), mq_receive(), mq_close() 

Test:
vinh@vinh-Inspiron-15-3520:~$ cat /dev/mqueue/myqueue 
QSIZE:42         NOTIFY:0     SIGNO:0     NOTIFY_PID:0  
-> This is after ./w

vinh@vinh-Inspiron-15-3520:~$ cat /dev/mqueue/myqueue 
QSIZE:0          NOTIFY:0     SIGNO:0     NOTIFY_PID:0  
-> This is after ./r